        <briefdescription>
<para>Constructs an instance of <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_u_i_image_component" kindref="compound">UIImageComponent</ref> with the given name and initializes it. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This constructor creates a new <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_u_i_image_component" kindref="compound">UIImageComponent</ref> with the provided name, sets its type to ImageComponent, retrieves all textures from the <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_asset_manager" kindref="compound">AssetManager</ref>&apos;s asset registry, stores their names in m_TextureNames, and finally creates an instance of <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_texture2_d" kindref="compound">Texture2D</ref> using default parameters.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
