</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The name for this <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_u_i_image_component" kindref="compound">UIImageComponent</ref>.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
Constructs an instance of <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_u_i_image_component" kindref="compound">UIImageComponent</ref> with the given name and initializes it with a default texture.</para>
<para>The constructor creates an unordered map of textures from the <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_asset_manager" kindref="compound">AssetManager</ref>&apos;s asset registry using GetTextures() method. It then iterates over this map, pushing each texture&apos;s name into m_TextureNames vector. Finally, it creates a new <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_texture2_d" kindref="compound">Texture2D</ref> instance with default specifications and assigns it to m_Image.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
